description = "Provisional entry (Claude, 2026-10-09): Stage III of the bluff whistler line, a sentinel with a tall folded membrane crest, a resonant throat with an ivory signal mark and a forked tail vane; vigilant and loyal, its whistle carries across the whole field. Working name pending Preston's approval. Arena sprite standing in for a front; no back view, default stats, no turn-based moves (Grok). Arena signature: High Signal."
